      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.432,
          "end": 2.88,
          "en": "-: Well the first thing you can do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.88,
          "end": 5.22,
          "en": "and for that I'm animating this, or excuse me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.22,
          "end": 7.53,
          "en": "I'm commenting this out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "If you wanted to use the same timing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 11.55,
          "en": "you don't have to duplicate this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.55,
          "end": 16.5,
          "en": "and simply write highlighted to normal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.5,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "Instead, you can use one line",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "and simply make an arrow point in both directions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 22.95,
          "en": "Now this means back and forth,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 24.72,
          "en": "use the same animate function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.72,
          "end": 28.02,
          "en": "So in this type of case used to 300 milliseconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.27,
          "en": "which now means we have the same timing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 32.22,
          "en": "That's one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.22,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "But also, you might have a more complex animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.98,
          "en": "where you want to control the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.98,
          "end": 39.75,
          "en": "this has during the movement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.75,
          "end": 41.88,
          "en": "So not the beginning, and not the end state;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.88,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "only during the transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "You might have some extra styles at this place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "or at this point of time too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "Well, to simulate this, let me copy this trigger here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 54.57,
          "en": "so that we keep the simple one too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 56.7,
          "en": "And I will name it wildState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "because it's getting more wild now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 61.29,
          "en": "So the wildState should now be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.29,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "to a new div I'm copying here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "to which is now bound to that new wildState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "It still uses my state property, don't get me wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 73.62,
          "en": "but, here it now uses the wildState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.62,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "Now with that, I'm binding it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 77.55,
          "en": "to the wildState animation trigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "I also want to set up a new property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.83,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "I'll name it wildState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 82.44,
          "end": 87.44,
          "en": "And therefore here in my component I'll duplicate normal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.51,
          "end": 90.24,
          "en": "and set this to wildState so that I have two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 90.24,
          "end": 93.003,
          "en": "different divs where we can see two different things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 96.24000000000001,
          "en": "Now, how does wildState work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.24000000000001,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "Or how do I want to control this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "Well, I still wanna have my normal and my highlighted style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 104.00999999999999,
          "en": "and I will leave the styling I have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 106.44,
          "en": "But, I wanna set up a third state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.44,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "This is the shrunken state, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 111.9,
          "en": "So I'm able to shrink this square.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 111.9,
          "end": 115.22999999999999,
          "en": "The background color, let's say, should then be green,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.22999999999999,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "and we transform it such that we wanna translate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 124.43,
          "en": "100 pixels, but we wanna scale it to 0.5, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.31,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "And no, let's actually translate it zero pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "so at the starting point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 135.27,
          "en": "Therefore, in the other two states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.27,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "we wanna scale it to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 139.833,
          "en": "So that's again, normal CSS setup here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "And with that we set up the different states.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 147.84,
          "en": "Now I wanna go back to where the two directions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.84,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "highlighted to normal, and normal to highlighted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 155.46,
          "en": "have different durations like we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.46,
          "end": 156.51,
          "en": "So like this, yeah,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "I could've just commented this out anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 161.79,
          "en": "Now I also wanna adjust this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.79,
          "end": 166.14,
          "en": "and also hook up this on shrink method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 166.14,
          "end": 167.97,
          "en": "or this shrink button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.97,
          "end": 172.97,
          "en": "So on shrink, shall now assign this wildState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.16,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "to be shrunken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 179.973,
          "en": "That is that third state I set up, up here, shrunken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.84,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "In onAnimate I therefore also,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 187.14,
          "en": "wanna set this wildState equal to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.14,
          "end": 190.56,
          "en": "or first compare it if it's equal to normal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 193.47,
          "en": "And if not, well I basically wanna do the same as here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.47,
          "end": 196.89,
          "en": "So let me quickly copy this and replace this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 196.89,
          "end": 199.47,
          "en": "So here I'm not using the shrunken state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.47,
          "end": 201.693,
          "en": "That's something I'm only setting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 208.203,
          "en": "Now with this setup, I can of course reload my application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.25,
          "end": 213,
          "en": "and once it does reload we should see a new square,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213,
          "end": 214.29,
          "en": "below the first one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 214.29,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "And maybe let's introduce a little divider here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 222.57,
          "en": "like a line break so that we can clearly see the difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 222.57,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "And now if we click animate, they both move",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 228.39,
          "en": "with different speeds, of course, because I changed this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.39,
          "end": 231.63,
          "en": "But shrinking still happens instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.63,
          "end": 234.3,
          "en": "So shrinking is not really animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.3,
          "end": 236.82,
          "en": "and that is something I want to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.82,
          "end": 238.35,
          "en": "So back in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.35,
          "end": 240.96,
          "en": "we basically need a third transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 240.96,
          "end": 242.79,
          "en": "because we're only targeting normal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 242.79,
          "end": 246.54,
          "en": "and highlighted and we're not using shrunken now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.54,
          "end": 249.81,
          "en": "To do that, I can use the following transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.81,
          "end": 253.44,
          "en": "where I transition from into shrunken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.44,
          "end": 255.06,
          "en": "and now from anywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.06,
          "end": 258.72,
          "en": "So I don't care if I have normal or highlighted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.72,
          "end": 261.15,
          "en": "No matter which of the both states it is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.15,
          "end": 263.55,
          "en": "I wanna play the same animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.55,
          "end": 265.65,
          "en": "And for that I can use the wild card character,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 265.65,
          "end": 267.12,
          "en": "which means any state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.12,
          "end": 271.29,
          "en": "So shrunken to any state and shrunken from any state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 271.29,
          "end": 273.72,
          "en": "should play the same animation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.72,
          "end": 276.96,
          "en": "For now, I'll animate it over 500 milliseconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.96,
          "end": 280.173,
          "en": "so that we can see something before I then fine tune this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.01,
          "end": 284.61,
          "en": "So after reloading this, if I now shrink it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 287.67,
          "en": "you see it shrink down and if I animate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.67,
          "end": 292.17,
          "en": "you now see it switch and animate correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 292.17,
          "end": 294.18,
          "en": "So now we are animating this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 294.18,
          "end": 295.83,
          "en": "and the wild card character here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 295.83,
          "end": 298.11,
          "en": "is the key to give us flexibility,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 298.11,
          "end": 301.83,
          "en": "that we don't manually have to specify any possible state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.83,
          "end": 303.15,
          "en": "and in our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 303.15,
          "end": 305.46,
          "en": "where you maybe derive the state dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 305.46,
          "end": 308.28,
          "en": "you might really not know which states it could have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 308.28,
          "end": 311.34,
          "en": "And there the wildcard character is what you need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 311.34,
          "end": 312.183,
          "en": "Now in the next video, I wanna dive in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 312.183,
          "end": 316.77,
          "en": "how to manipulate this animate function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 316.77,
          "end": 319.923,
          "en": "and have some in between styles during the animation.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
